msgctxt "3624"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san. You're from Tokyo, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636"
msgid "In a broad sense, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3648"
msgid "Cool! I'm actually from Tokyo, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3660"
msgid "Really? What part?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3672"
msgid ""
"I used to live in Nerima! I grew up in Kanagawa, where my family lives, but "
"I moved to the city for work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3684"
msgid "I certainly spent more than a few evenings living it up in Kamurocho. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3696"
msgid "Is that so? Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3708"
msgid ""
"Kamurocho's great. There's always something new and exciting to do, no "
"matter the time of day. The city never sleeps!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3720"
msgid "Heh, you're right about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3732"
msgid "I have to admit, though, I do miss Tokyo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3744"
msgid "How'd you end up in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3756"
msgid ""
"Heh, everyone asks me that. Is it 'cause I look like I'm not\r\n"
"from around here? Even with the flower and the tan? Aww man.\r\n"
"Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3768"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3780"
msgid ""
"Well, I like to tell people that I was completely enchanted by the warm, "
"tropical sun and the beautiful, clear ocean. I just couldn't leave them "
"behind! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3792"
msgid "Not too hard to believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3804"
msgid "How long are you here for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3816"
msgid "Well, actually... I want to live here permanently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3828"
msgid "Oh, wow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3840"
msgid "Why's that, if you don't mind me asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3852"
msgid ""
"Hehe. Well, I could tell you why, on one condition: promise you'll keep "
"coming here and requesting me from now on!  Then maaaybe I'll tell you. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3864"
msgid "All right, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3876"
msgid "Did you come here by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3888"
msgid "Actually, yes, I did! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3900"
msgid "Wow. That takes some courage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3912"
msgid ""
"Hehe, I don't know about that... To tell the truth, it was sort of a spur "
"of the moment kind of thing. I barely sorted anything out before I hopped "
"on the plane over here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3924"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3936"
msgid "Can you go into any further detail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3948"
msgid ""
"Hehe. Well, I could tell you why, on one condition: promise you'll keep "
"coming here and requesting me from now on!  Then maaaybe I'll tell you. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3960"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, have you had any trouble understanding the words and phrases "
"they use here in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3984"
msgid "A little, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3996"
msgid ""
"The people here have all sorts of words and phrases that I couldn't even "
"start to understand! For example, they refer to themselves and mainlanders "
"totally differently!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4008"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid ""
"Take \"shimanchu\" and \"uchinanchu,\" for example. I knew \"shima\" meant "
"\"island,\" but the rest completely bewildered me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4032"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! ♪ The first time I heard someone refer to themselves that way, I "
"was  completely lost!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4044"
msgid "Yeah, I was definitely confused by that at first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4056"
msgid ""
"What else... Oh, they call trash cans \"chiribako\" instead of "
"\"gomibako\"! \"Dust\" cans instead of \"trash\" cans! I think that's "
"really cute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4068"
msgid "Ooh, I thought of another thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4080"
msgid ""
"In Tokyo, and pretty much everywhere else, when you leave work, you kinda "
"half-apologize for not being the last one to leave, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4092"
msgid ""
"But here in Okinawa, they aren't formal about it at all! They pretty much "
"just say, \"Okay, I'm outta here, bye!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4104"
msgid "That's a pretty drastic difference, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4116"
msgid ""
"Hehe! ♪ I've really taken an interest in all the little language "
"differences between here and the mainland. I can tell you some more, if "
"you'd like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4128"
msgid "That's enough for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4140"
msgid "Oh. You... don't want to hear any more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4152"
msgid "Yeah, I'm good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4164"
msgid "There are so many cool Okinawan words, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4176"
msgid "...I figure I'll get to them eventually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4188"
msgid "Yeah, I'm learning a whole lot. Thanks for the lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4200"
msgid ""
"Hehe, you're quite welcome! Feel free to ask me about cool Okinawan words "
"anytime! I love talking about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4212"
msgid "Will do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4224"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You can use that opportunity to tell me "
"more about yourself, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4236"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4248"
msgid "I'd love to hear more sometime. Thanks for the lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4260"
msgid ""
"Hehe. Feel free to ask me about cool Okinawan words anytime! ♪ I love "
"talking about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4272"
msgid "I definitely will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284"
msgid "Sounds good! ♪ There's just one thing you'll have to do for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4296"
msgid "And what's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4308"
msgid ""
"You have to tell me more about yourself, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4320"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4332"
msgid ""
"As much as I loved going out on the town in Kamurocho, and the rest of "
"Tokyo, too, I really didn't have much time to party. I was always so busy "
"with work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4344"
msgid "What did you do for work over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4356"
msgid "I was the secretary for the president of a brokerage firm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4368"
msgid "...Wow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380"
msgid ""
"Hehe. ♪ I think you can imagine how busy that kept me. After all the things "
"they had me doing for the company, I feel like I came out of it as a jack "
"of all trades!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4392"
msgid "Sounds like a tough job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4404"
msgid ""
"You've got that right, hehe. Despite how busy it was, I did get a lot of "
"valuable experience out of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4416"
msgid ""
"For example, I learned how to make reservations at somewhat shady "
"restaurants, and how to lie about our company dealings to the president's "
"wife..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4428"
msgid ""
"To be honest, sometimes I found myself thinking, \"Wait, should this even "
"be part of my job!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4440"
msgid "A brokerage firm... Sounds like they kept you busy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4452"
msgid "It really was! Everyone there worked long into the night most days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4464"
msgid "I'm impressed you all could handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4476"
msgid ""
"Many couldn't! A lot just up and quit after a few months... I didn't, "
"though. I stayed a secretary the whole time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4488"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4500"
msgid "Secretary to the president... Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4512"
msgid ""
"That's right... Hey, now, you're not getting any weird ideas about that, "
"are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4524"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4536"
msgid ""
"Oh, please. I know that look on your face! You were definitely getting some "
"weird ideas about me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4548"
msgid ""
"Whenever I tell men that I was the secretary to the president of a company, "
"they start asking me if I did any \"extra\" favors for him, or how "
"\"rough\" the work was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4560"
msgid "...That's not what I was going for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572"
msgid "What sort of other things did you do for them as a secretary?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4584"
msgid "Hmm, let's see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4596"
msgid ""
"One time, he had me line up early outside a department store to buy a "
"limited-edition toy that his grandkid really wanted..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4608"
msgid ""
"There were even times where he made me go on dates with his most important "
"clients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4620"
msgid "That sounds awful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4632"
msgid ""
"It was. Still, when I tell people I had to do all of those things, they're "
"always so surprised..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4644"
msgid ""
"But in spite of all the trouble I suffered through, I ended\r\n"
"up gaining a lot of relevant, career-level experience!\r\n"
"Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4656"
msgid "Heh, glad it was worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4668"
msgid "Kiryu-san, have you heard of \"Okinawa time\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4680"
msgid "Okinawa time? Is that like a special time zone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4692"
msgid "Hehe, I guess you aren't in the know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4704"
msgid "Well, what is it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4716"
msgid "It's an old Okinawan custom, or at least, that's what the locals say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4728"
msgid "Okay. What's it all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4740"
msgid ""
"So, let's say you planned to meet up with someone around noon. You'd expect "
"them to show up around twelve, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4752"
msgid ""
"Well, a native Okinawan would show up an hour later, or worse! That's "
"Okinawa time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4764"
msgid "Really? That's a thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4776"
msgid ""
"Yes, really! Of course, there are Okinawans who like to be on time, but I "
"think most natives tend to show up on the later side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4788"
msgid ""
"Continuing my example, though! They won't show up at twelve, but they'll "
"text you at twelve, and it won't be what you'd expect! Guess, what do you "
"think they say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4800"
msgid "\"Sorry, I'm gonna be late\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4812"
msgid "Nope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4824"
msgid "They'll ask, \"Hey, when're you leaving?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4836"
msgid "Really? Can't say I'd be happy to get that text."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848"
msgid "Right? ♪ But I suppose that's just how they do things in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4860"
msgid "But like I said before, not every Okinawan is like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872"
msgid "...Though that's what usually happens around here. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4884"
msgid "That's no good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4896"
msgid "I know, right? That's not an aspect of culture you usually think about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4908"
msgid ""
"When I came here, I heard of these kinds of things happening to my friends, "
"but when it actually happened to me, I got really frustrated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4920"
msgid "I can imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4932"
msgid ""
"But once you get used to it, it's no big deal. Think of it as operating on, "
"well, a special time zone, like you said. Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4944"
msgid "Guess I had it right all along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4956"
msgid "That's good to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4968"
msgid ""
"Right? You'd definitely get annoyed if you had no idea about this custom, "
"went to meet up with your Okinawan friends, and they didn't show up on time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4980"
msgid "For sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4992"
msgid ""
"Hehe. ♪ Now that you know about Okinawa time, though, you should have no "
"problem making friends with native Okinawans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5004"
msgid "Yeah. Thanks for the tip."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5016"
msgid "Must be the Okinawan way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5028"
msgid ""
"Wow, Kiryu-san. Do those kind of things not bother you? You don't mind if "
"people are late?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5040"
msgid "...I'm not sure, to be honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5052"
msgid ""
"But I can understand why living on this island might make people stop "
"caring so much about being on time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5064"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I totally get what you mean! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5076"
msgid ""
"That's what makes Okinawa such an amazing place to live. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5088"
msgid "You've got that right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5100"
msgid "Kiryu-san, did you have any pets growing up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5112"
msgid "...No. Never had one, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5124"
msgid "Neither did I! When I moved to Okinawa, though, I got a cat..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5136"
msgid "...But I had no idea how I was supposed to take care of him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148"
msgid "He constantly meowed at me. I would always meow right back at him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5160"
msgid "Heh. That's cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5172"
msgid "I named him Tuna. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5184"
msgid ""
"The reason's pretty silly. The first time I fed him, I gave him canned "
"tuna, and he just couldn't get enough of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5196"
msgid ""
"From that moment on, I started calling him my little Tuna! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5208"
msgid ""
"Recently, though, Tuna's gotten real picky about his food. He'll only eat "
"the beef and chicken flavor, and only the expensive brand, too! What am I "
"going to do with this cat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5220"
msgid "Sounds like a fussy feline."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5232"
msgid "Yes, and it's taking a toll on my wallet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5244"
msgid "Tuna's a good name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5256"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ Thank you, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5268"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you'd be as shocked as I was when I saw him wolfing down that can "
"of tuna! I swear, you'd think it was the first time he'd been fed in weeks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5280"
msgid "You sure make it sound like a sight to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5292"
msgid ""
"I wish he'd be more like his name and go back to eating cheap cans of tuna. "
"If he won't do it for me, he could at least do it for my wallet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5304"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5316"
msgid "What kind of cat is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5328"
msgid "A Norwegian forest cat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5340"
msgid ""
"They're not very well-known in Japan, but they're pretty popular in America "
"and Europe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5352"
msgid ""
"They say they used to live in the frozen forests of Norway. Apparently they "
"bring good luck, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5364"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5376"
msgid ""
"I wish Tuna would share a little of that luck with me sometime!\r\n"
"Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5388"
msgid "Heh. Fingers crossed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400"
msgid "What a spoiled cat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5412"
msgid "He sure is... Sometimes I think he's being evil on purpose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5424"
msgid "Should I say a little prayer for it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5436"
msgid ""
"You should pray for Tuna to be a little less picky! I've tried giving him "
"food that's a bit easier on my bank account, but he takes one look at it "
"and walks off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5448"
msgid "I never knew cats could be this choosy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5460"
msgid "I guess beggars can be choosers, sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5472"
msgid ""
"You know, when I moved to Okinawa, I realized there's a big difference "
"between people here and people from the mainland."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5484"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5496"
msgid "People from Okinawa have completely different attitudes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5508"
msgid "I'm not sure how to describe it exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5520"
msgid ""
"It feels like the walls they put up between each other are much lower. Does "
"that make sense?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5532"
msgid "You can see it in the way they speak, or how they approach one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5544"
msgid ""
"They're straightforward about how they feel about people, and they're so "
"warm and friendly to everyone. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5556"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5568"
msgid ""
"I know so! When they're walking down the street, they'll greet everyone, "
"even strangers, with a friendly \"Hey, what's up, brother?\" It's so sweet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5580"
msgid ""
"They aren't shy at all! ♪ And when they talk to you, they make you feel "
"like you've known them forever. There's this level of friendliness that "
"you'd never see in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5592"
msgid "It's a completely different culture here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5604"
msgid ""
"Exactly! I've been all over Japan, but I've never seen anyone act like "
"this. It's only something I've experienced while living here in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5616"
msgid "Really? That's surprising."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5628"
msgid "I mean, every place has their upsides and downsides, sure, but still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5640"
msgid ""
"Between the glittering ocean, the warm sun, and the kind people, I know "
"that my decision to move to Okinawa was the right one. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5652"
msgid "Heh. I'm glad you're happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5664"
msgid "Maybe you feel that way because you used to live in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5676"
msgid "...I suppose that would make sense, sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5688"
msgid ""
"But lots of people from Tokyo are actually from rural areas.\r\n"
"Maybe that's why they don't want to be too friendly with one\r\n"
"another... because no one knows who anyone is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5700"
msgid ""
"If you went to Tokyo and tried to strike up a casual conversation with "
"someone on the train or bus, they'd think you were crazy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5712"
msgid "You've got a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5724"
msgid "We could learn something from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5736"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5748"
msgid ""
"You might have a point there... but I don't think that's really possible, "
"at least, not with the way things are in real life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5760"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5772"
msgid ""
"Well, for one, our lives run at a much faster pace than they do here in "
"Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5784"
msgid ""
"If you went to Tokyo and tried to strike up a casual conversation with "
"someone, they'd think you were crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5796"
msgid "You've got a point..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5808"
msgid "So, have you done any sightseeing around Okinawa since you've moved here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5820"
msgid "You know, I don't think I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5832"
msgid ""
"Well, if you ever have to go outside of the city, you should definitely get "
"a car."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5844"
msgid ""
"The monorail doesn't run outside of the city, so you really have no choice. "
"It's either a car, or bust!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5856"
msgid "I'll remember that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5868"
msgid "I live a bit far from the city myself, but I don't own a car..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880"
msgid "...I own a bicycle! Hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5892"
msgid "A bicycle? Must be good exercise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5904"
msgid "It is! My thighs are nice and toned now. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5916"
msgid ""
"When I first started here, everyone was so shocked to hear that I biked to "
"work every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5928"
msgid ""
"Imagine how shocked they were to see me walking out of the\r\n"
"changing room in full riding gear at the end of the day! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5940"
msgid "You certainly don't see that every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5952"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, when I've had a little too much to drink, I'll give in and call "
"a taxi. I'm not that crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5964"
msgid ""
"There are so many great reasons to ride a bike, though: it's "
"environmentally friendly, it saves money, it's super fun, and best of all, "
"it's healthy for you! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5976"
msgid "What kind of bicycle do you ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5988"
msgid "I ride a racing bicycle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6000"
msgid "Whoa, really? That's a surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6012"
msgid "I know... It's a little weird, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6024"
msgid "No, not at all. Sounds pretty practical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6036"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank goodness! ♪ I don't know what I would have done if you'd told me "
"I'd look better on a girly cruiser bike with a big basket..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6048"
msgid "I'm sure you'd look good riding one of those, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6060"
msgid "Must be great for your health, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6072"
msgid ""
"The only bad thing is how sweaty you get. Though it does feel a little nice "
"to get sweaty like that! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6084"
msgid "You sure see the positives in everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6096"
msgid ""
"Hehe, thanks. Have you ever thought about using a bike to get around town, "
"Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108"
msgid "Not yet, but maybe I'll give it some thought now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6120"
msgid "How long does it take to get here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6132"
msgid "From home, you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6144"
msgid "Yeah. Is it a long ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6156"
msgid "Around 30 minutes maybe? It's a little far from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168"
msgid "30 minutes? That's a good workout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6180"
msgid "Hehehe! ♪ You hit the nail right on the head!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6192"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6204"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you have any hobbies?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6216"
msgid "Not really, to be honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6228"
msgid ""
"Well, mine's a different than what you might think: I'm really into "
"bodyboarding!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6240"
msgid "Wow. You're right. I would never have guessed that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6252"
msgid ""
"I started doing it last year, but now that I've gotten better at it, I'm "
"having so much fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6264"
msgid "It's good to find a hobby you enjoy doing, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6276"
msgid ""
"The only downside is that because I'm out in the sun, bodysurfing all the "
"time, I've gotten really tan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6288"
msgid "I can see that, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6300"
msgid ""
"You know, despite the stereotypes, you can still find some pale-skinned "
"people here in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6312"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6324"
msgid ""
"Though, everyone seems to buy into the stereotype that all Okinawans have "
"dark, tanned skin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6336"
msgid "Most tourists just assume I'm another native Okinawan! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6348"
msgid "I prefer women with lighter skin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6360"
msgid "Oh... Okay, then... You're into paler girls, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6372"
msgid "Yeah, they're more my type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6384"
msgid "So, then... why did you specifically request a girl like me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6396"
msgid "No, well, I didn't mean it like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6408"
msgid "You know, all the girls here are pretty tan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6420"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6432"
msgid "I like a girl with a healthy tan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6444"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6456"
msgid "You bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6468"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Here I was, thinking you might be into "
"girls who were more pale, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6480"
msgid "Yeah, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6492"
msgid "I'd probably make the same mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6504"
msgid "I know, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6516"
msgid "And it's not just me! I know another transplant from Hokkaido..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6528"
msgid "And she's like, three times darker than I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6540"
msgid "Wow. That's a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6552"
msgid ""
"You know, maybe everyone actually really likes tanned skin, instead of pale "
"skin..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6564"
msgid "...Who knows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6576"
msgid "Have you noticed how things are a little more expensive here in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6588"
msgid "Hmm... You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6600"
msgid ""
"Oh, definitely! Everything's priced a little higher. Even the vegetables "
"can be way more expensive here than on the mainland!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612"
msgid "But on the other hand, rent is so wonderfully cheap. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6624"
msgid "I couldn't imagine paying rent this low in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6636"
msgid "And here, you don't need to pay any gratuity fees when you move in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6648"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6660"
msgid ""
"Yes! And plenty of places in the city don't even make you put down a "
"security deposit. It's great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6672"
msgid "That's pretty nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6684"
msgid ""
"I got a miraculous deal when I started renting the place I'm living at now. "
"They let me sign the lease without putting down a security deposit or "
"paying a gratuity fee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6696"
msgid "I even haggled my landlord into a better deal on rent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6708"
msgid "Wow, that is pretty miraculous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6720"
msgid "Yes! It's only costing me 5,000 yen a month to live there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6732"
msgid "I couldn't ask for a better landlord! ♪ Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6744"
msgid "What's the place like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6756"
msgid "It's just a regular old apartment. Nothing fancy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6768"
msgid "Oh. Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6780"
msgid "What, did you think it was going to be some broken-down shack?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6792"
msgid "Not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6804"
msgid "It's in a nice apartment building. The doors automatically lock, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6816"
msgid "A place like that in Tokyo would probably go for around 150,000 yen a month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6828"
msgid "Wow. Sounds pretty nice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6840"
msgid "How'd you trick them into that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6852"
msgid "With my charming smile, of course! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6864"
msgid ""
"You better not be getting any weird ideas about my methods now, all right? "
"Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6876"
msgid "No weird ideas here, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6888"
msgid ""
"Watch out, Kiryu-san, or I'll use my miraculous haggling skills on you, "
"too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6900"
msgid "Heh, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6912"
msgid "That's... That's some intense haggling..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6924"
msgid "Really? I don't think it was that intense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6936"
msgid ""
"I threw the number out there just to see if it would work, and the landlord "
"said it'd be okay. That was all. Nothing too special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6948"
msgid "There's got to be something wrong with the apartment, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6960"
msgid "Would you not say that, please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6972"
msgid "I love my apartment. It's a really nice place to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6984"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6996"
msgid ""
"You know, something happened to me recently that made me find a new "
"appreciation for the people of Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7008"
msgid "Yeah? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7020"
msgid ""
"One of the roads I use to get home is a really busy street with tons of "
"traffic. It's a pretty dangerous road for pedestrians and bikers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7032"
msgid ""
"Despite that, there was this old lady trying to jaywalk across the street, "
"right in the middle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7044"
msgid "Uh-oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7056"
msgid "I got off my bike and went to go help her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7068"
msgid "But before I got to her, all the cars slowed to a stop so she could cross!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7080"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7092"
msgid ""
"Yup, hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Traffic was backed up for a long time "
"while they waited for her to get across the street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7104"
msgid ""
"I asked my friend about it afterwards, and she told me, \"Okinawans always "
"let their grandmas do as they please.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7116"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7128"
msgid "Oh, everyone in Okinawa calls old men and women \"grandpa\" or \"grandma.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7140"
msgid ""
"And because Okinawan women are such hard workers, grandmas sit right at the "
"top of the totem pole, so everyone lets them do what they want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7152"
msgid "I never knew that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7164"
msgid ""
"That's why nobody complains, even if there's a grandma jaywalking across "
"six lanes of traffic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7176"
msgid ""
"It's just another wonderful part of the Okinawan culture I've come to love "
"and cherish. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7188"
msgid "I'd have to agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7200"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you do! It's lovely the kind of respect that Okinawans have for "
"their elders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7212"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7224"
msgid "Maybe one day, when I'm a grandma, I'll jaywalk just like she did!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7236"
msgid "Maybe you should put that dream on the back burner..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7248"
msgid "What about grandpas?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7260"
msgid "Hmmm... I've heard they get a little bit of special treatment, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7272"
msgid "They get \"offerings\"... I think that's what they call them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7284"
msgid "Offerings? What, do they get treated like gods?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7296"
msgid "Oh, I'm sure it's just an exaggeration! It can't be more than just trinkets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7308"
msgid ""
"Still, since the grandmas work much harder, grandpas really don't rank "
"higher than them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7320"
msgid "Is that how it works..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7332"
msgid "Don't worry, Kiryu-san. I like the grandpas, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7344"
msgid "(...Is she talking about me?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7356"
msgid "Well, there's got to be limits to that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7368"
msgid ""
"I'm sure there are, but still, isn't it nice? Okinawans have so much "
"respect for their elders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7380"
msgid ""
"Sure, but if everyone always did what they wanted, wouldn't that just be "
"all sorts of trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7392"
msgid "Well, I suppose, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7404"
msgid "Sorry, I must have weirded you out with this topic..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7428"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, thank you so much for hanging out with me! I had a lot of fun. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7440"
msgid "I did, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7452"
msgid "Let's go again sometime. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7464"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7476"
msgid "Still, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7488"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7500"
msgid "...I swear I saw someone fishy staring at us. Did you see them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7512"
msgid "Maybe it's just my imagination, but I still feel like I'm being followed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7524"
msgid "Got any ideas or leads?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7536"
msgid "Hmm. I can't think of any..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7548"
msgid "All right, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7560"
msgid "If I feel like I'm being followed again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7572"
msgid "Could I talk to you about it, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7584"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7596"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! That makes me feel so much better.\r\n"
"You're the best! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7608"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7620"
msgid "You think it could be a stalker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7632"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7644"
msgid "I hope not. That's a really scary thought..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7656"
msgid "Do you think I should go to the police?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7668"
msgid "Well, we can't say for certain that you're being stalked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7680"
msgid "You might have to wait it out and see if that's the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7692"
msgid "I'm sure I'm just imagining things..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7704"
msgid "Well, just call me if anything happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7716"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7728"
msgid "Want me to walk you home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7740"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes! Thank you, Kiryu-san! I'm sure I'd feel much safer with you by my "
"side!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7752"
msgid "Don't be shy about it, either. Call me anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7764"
msgid ""
"Thank you, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I feel so much better "
"already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7776"
msgid "You mean it, then? When I feel scared or worried, I can call you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7788"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7800"
msgid ""
"A few days ago, I got a call from one of my aunts. We hadn't spoken in a "
"while, so it was a bit of a surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7812"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7824"
msgid "She was pretty mad at me, demanding that I give my parents a call..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7836"
msgid "You haven't called them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7848"
msgid "No... I moved here without telling them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7860"
msgid "My parents must be so worried... I'm a terrible daughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7872"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7884"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7896"
msgid "But I'm the one who made them so worried in the first place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7908"
msgid "Then maybe you should give them a call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7920"
msgid "Yeah, I should..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7932"
msgid "But what if they're too angry with me to pick up the phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7944"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7956"
msgid "Why don't you give them a call every now and then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7968"
msgid ""
"I probably should... But I doubt my father will forgive me.\r\n"
"Not for running off to Okinawa without a word to anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7980"
msgid "I'm sure if he sees you're doing well, he'll change his tune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7992"
msgid "I hope so, but still, I just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8004"
msgid "Want me to go with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8016"
msgid ""
"Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'll be fine. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You "
"don't have to do that for me, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8028"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8040"
msgid "You're so sweet, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8052"
msgid "Parents are supposed to be worried about their kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8064"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8076"
msgid "You're not a bad daughter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8088"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8100"
msgid ""
"Yeah. No matter what happens, you'll always be their daughter, and they'll "
"always be your mom and dad. There's no changing that. They'll always worry "
"about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8112"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8124"
msgid "I wish I had your positive attitude, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8148"
msgid "So, I went on a date with someone from Okinawa a while back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8160"
msgid "It ended up being a total letdown. The guy was such a lazemeister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8172"
msgid "A lazemeister? Was he that much of a loser?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8184"
msgid ""
"Yeah! My friends all said they've had dates like that here, too... Maybe "
"there's something about Okinawa that makes you more likely to run into lazy "
"good-for-nothings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8196"
msgid "Okinawa has a pretty high rate of unemployment⑬and a high divorce rate, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8208"
msgid "I've heard that, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8220"
msgid ""
"Of course, I'm sure there are some wonderful Okinawan guys out there, but "
"I'm sorry to say that if I was told to imagine a typical Okinawan man, I'd "
"think of some slacker..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8232"
msgid "I wonder why that is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8244"
msgid "Maybe the heat fries their brains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8256"
msgid ""
"I can understand. Sometimes it's so hot, all you want to do is laze around "
"in your room..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8268"
msgid "You know the Okinawan saying \"nankurunaisa\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8280"
msgid "\"It'll all work out\"? Yeah, I've heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8292"
msgid ""
"That's the one. It's supposed to mean living without worry. But to be "
"honest... I don't think that's the best way to live your life all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304"
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8316"
msgid "Could just be that one guy you went out with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8328"
msgid "True. I'm sure that's the case, but still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8340"
msgid ""
"When I asked some of my Okinawan friends about it, they said it's pretty "
"common."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8352"
msgid "You know the Okinawan saying \"nankurunaisa\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8364"
msgid "\"It'll all work out\"? Yeah, I've heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8376"
msgid ""
"That's the one. It's supposed to mean living without worry. But to be "
"honest... I don't think that's the best way to live your life all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8388"
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8400"
msgid "Relax. Guys just want to have freedom in their life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8412"
msgid "Huh? Kiryu-san, do you mean that...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8424"
msgid "Nah... I was just joking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8436"
msgid "Oh, geez! Don't scare me like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8448"
msgid "Don't tell me you're like that bum I dated..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8460"
msgid "Not on my life. I've always been a man of my word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8472"
msgid ""
"You're right. Besides, you don't look like you'd be that kind of guy, "
"Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8484"
msgid "You know the Okinawan saying \"nankurunaisa\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8496"
msgid "\"It'll all work out\"? Yeah, I've heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8508"
msgid ""
"That's the one. It's supposed to mean living without worry. But to be "
"honest... I don't think that's the best way to live your life all the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8520"
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8532"
msgid ""
"So the other day, I was in the store, and I saw this little girl throwing a "
"tantrum over a toy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8544"
msgid "She kept screaming at her mother, \"I want it! I want it!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8556"
msgid "To be honest, I got a little jealous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8568"
msgid "Jealous? What for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8580"
msgid ""
"Well, when I was a little girl, I never did anything like that to my "
"parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8592"
msgid "I guess I was a bit jealous that the kid in the store could do that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8604"
msgid "You were a good kid, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8616"
msgid "Well, it's not like I was perfect, just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8628"
msgid "My parents never really scolded me for anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8640"
msgid "So I get a little jealous of kids who have parents who will scold them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8652"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8664"
msgid "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to make things weird..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8676"
msgid "Did you ever want to do something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8688"
msgid "Well, no, not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8700"
msgid "My parents never really scolded me for anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8712"
msgid "So I get a little jealous of kids who have parents who will scold them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8724"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8736"
msgid "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to make things weird..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8748"
msgid "Have you tried being honest with your parents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8760"
msgid ""
"It's always a good thing to have your parents in the picture, even if you "
"fight with them sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8772"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8784"
msgid ""
"I think I just realized something important. Thank you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8796"
msgid "...No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8808"
msgid "You're still the same girl now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8820"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8832"
msgid "You moved out here to Okinawa without telling them first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8844"
msgid "When you put it that way.... yeah, you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8856"
msgid "My parents never really scolded me for anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8868"
msgid "So I get a little jealous of kids who have parents who will scold them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8880"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8892"
msgid "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to make things weird..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8904"
msgid "I've got a problem, Kiryu-san. Will you hear me out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8916"
msgid "Of course. Shoot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8928"
msgid ""
"A lot of younger guys have taken a liking to me nowadays. I know I'm just "
"being picky, but... I wish they wouldn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8940"
msgid "You don't like younger guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8952"
msgid "I mean... I'm into older guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8964"
msgid "Every guy I've ever dated has been ten or more years older than me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8976"
msgid ""
"There's so much to learn from older guys! I love that about them. They're "
"just so much fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8988"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9000"
msgid "Though I guess that might be how younger guys think of me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9012"
msgid "They want to learn things from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9024"
msgid "Yeah... I suppose they could learn a few things from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9036"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Things that only a mature, seasoned woman would know how to teach a "
"guy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9048"
msgid "Kiryu-san...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9060"
msgid "Geez! I'd really like it if you didn't make this something weird and sexual!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9072"
msgid "I'm just kidding..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9084"
msgid "They like you because you're amazing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9096"
msgid ""
"Aww, thank you, Kiryu-san. You're going to make me blush. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9108"
msgid "I wonder why it's only younger men, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9120"
msgid "That, I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9132"
msgid "Older guys suit you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9144"
msgid "You think so too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9156"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9168"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Well, thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9180"
msgid ""
"I'd love to go on a date with someone as cool and composed as you, "
"Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9192"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9204"
msgid ""
"So the other day, I was having a bit of girl talk with a friend of mine, "
"and the topic of relationships came up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9216"
msgid "I can't help but feel like my love life's in jeopardy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9228"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9240"
msgid ""
"Well, I was having a really hard time keeping the conversation going with "
"her. She's so much younger than me, and I'm already 29..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9252"
msgid ""
"Whenever I talk about guys and relationships, I end up talking about "
"income, or savings, or retirement, stuff like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9264"
msgid ""
"It's like I've completely forgotten about the romance aspect... Like I'm "
"not expecting it to happen to me at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9276"
msgid "It's too late for you now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9288"
msgid "Nooo! I knew it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9300"
msgid "You know what they say, though: a woman in love is twice as beautiful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9312"
msgid ""
"Oh no! I completely forgot about that saying... And if it's really true, "
"then... Then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9324"
msgid "...I'm doomed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9336"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, please! Is it really too late for me? Will I never be able to "
"love again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9348"
msgid "No, I think you'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9360"
msgid "...Wait, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9372"
msgid ""
"I was just kidding before. You're an amazing woman. You shouldn't have any "
"problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9384"
msgid "You mean it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9396"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9408"
msgid ""
"Oh, gosh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're going to make me blush. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9420"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9432"
msgid "Depends on your mental state."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9444"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9456"
msgid "When you fall in love, you'll forget about all of those other things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9468"
msgid ""
"Right! They do say love blinds you to anything except for the object of "
"your affections! Maybe there's hope after all. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9480"
msgid "Yeah. You'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9492"
msgid "I'm starting to feel a lot better now. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9504"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9516"
msgid "Has it been a while for you, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9528"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9540"
msgid "Uh, has it been a while since you were last in love?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9552"
msgid ""
"You're terrible, Kiryu-san... Just because I'm 29 and single doesn't mean "
"my love life has been completely barren and loveless..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9564"
msgid "And besides, why on earth would I answer that question!? Have some manners!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9576"
msgid "Sorry about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9588"
msgid ""
"So, why did you come to Okinawa? Was it for a long-term vacation, or "
"something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9600"
msgid "Yeah, that's about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9612"
msgid ""
"That sounds nice! ♪ Everyone thinks of Okinawa as the perfect place to go "
"on vacation, what with all the resorts and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9624"
msgid "Yeah, I'd agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9636"
msgid "I thought the same way, too, at least, before I moved over here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9648"
msgid ""
"But once I settled in, I started to learn about all the problems in "
"Okinawa, like its high unemployment rate..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9660"
msgid ""
"I had trouble finding a job here, too. I suppose it's not as easy for a "
"woman in her late twenties! Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9672"
msgid ""
"Luckily, I ended up getting a job offer at this club, and meeting a bunch "
"of nice customers. I count my blessings every day! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9684"
msgid "Guess life isn't all that easy in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9696"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9708"
msgid ""
"I don't think the problem is limited to Okinawa, either. Things are getting "
"pretty tough all over the country."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9720"
msgid "You're telling me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9732"
msgid "Still, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9744"
msgid "It just goes to show you how amazing the people of Okinawa really are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9756"
msgid ""
"They never let their dire situation get them down! They just take it one "
"day at a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9768"
msgid "Nice and easy, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9780"
msgid "There's so much we can learn from them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9792"
msgid "You're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9804"
msgid "You really are lucky to work here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9816"
msgid "Isn't that the truth! They pulled me out of a real pickle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9828"
msgid "Not many places would hire an old lady like me. Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9840"
msgid "You're not an old lady at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9852"
msgid "No, it's all right. ♪ I've accepted it. I'm 29, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9864"
msgid "Okay then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9876"
msgid "It's hard to see past the vacation facade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9888"
msgid "I know, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9900"
msgid ""
"The first time we learn about Okinawa, usually it's because someone's "
"talking about vacations or fancy resorts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9912"
msgid "That's accurate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9924"
msgid "Still, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9936"
msgid "It just goes to show you how amazing the people of Okinawa really are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9948"
msgid ""
"They never let their dire situation get them down! They just take it one "
"day at a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9960"
msgid "Nice and easy, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9972"
msgid "There's so much we can learn from them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9984"
msgid "You're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9996"
msgid "Hey, do you remember my cat, Tuna?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10008"
msgid "Yeah, how's he doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10020"
msgid ""
"He's doing great! Cute as always. ♪ And he still insists on eating beef and "
"chicken, despite the whole reason I named him Tuna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10032"
msgid "Heh. Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10044"
msgid ""
"So the other day, I was hanging out with Tuna, and this weird thought "
"popped into my head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10056"
msgid "I think I might've been a dog in my past life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10068"
msgid "A dog? What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10080"
msgid "Well, you know how everyone thinks of dogs as being submissive and obedient?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10092"
msgid ""
"I mean, if you want to take it a little further, they're collared, chained, "
"and strictly trained..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10104"
msgid ""
"In a way, I feel like that's how I've lived my life... chained up, like a "
"dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10116"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10128"
msgid "I wish I could live life as carefree as Tuna does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10140"
msgid ""
"He's not tied down by anything or anyone. He can go wherever he wants, do "
"whatever he wants, and eat expensive canned food without caring about what "
"it costs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10152"
msgid "You're only tied down by your past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10164"
msgid "I suppose..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10176"
msgid ""
"Now that you're here, you can have fun and drink the night away. That's "
"pretty great, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10188"
msgid ""
"You shouldn't let yourself obsess over what happened in the past. Instead, "
"you should think about the future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10200"
msgid "Maybe you're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10212"
msgid "Geez, what the heck is wrong with me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10224"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10236"
msgid "You're free to do what you want now, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10248"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10260"
msgid ""
"Now that you're out here, you can live life how you want.\r\n"
"You shouldn't have to feel cooped up at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10272"
msgid "I suppose..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10284"
msgid ""
"In the end, you're just letting yourself get caught up in the past. You "
"should look to the present instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10296"
msgid "You're absolutely right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10308"
msgid ""
"No matter what happened in the past, it doesn't change the fact that I'm "
"having a great time here and now with you, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10320"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10332"
msgid "I'm jealous of Tuna, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10344"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10356"
msgid "I wish I were a cat, lounging around without a care in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10368"
msgid "Maybe that's how everyone feels nowadays..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10380"
msgid "Maybe. Could be they're all tired of the stress of real life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10392"
msgid "...Well, this conversation took a dark turn, didn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10404"
msgid "...Yeah. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10416"
msgid "Oh, hey! Have you ever done a crossword puzzle, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10428"
msgid "No, I can't really say that I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10440"
msgid ""
"Really? Well, I've been really getting into them lately. ♪ Once I start "
"one, I can't stop till I'm done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10452"
msgid "Is that right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10464"
msgid ""
"Has that ever happened to you? Where you started something, and just "
"couldn't stop until you'd finished?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10476"
msgid ""
"That happens to me every time! Once I get going, I've gotta finish it, even "
"if it means staying up way past sunrise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10488"
msgid "You spend a lot of nights alone, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10500"
msgid "Uh... I suppose, but it's not like I'm lonely or anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10512"
msgid "I can keep you company if you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10524"
msgid "...How is this your takeaway from my interest in crossword puzzles?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10536"
msgid "Are you even listening to me, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10548"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10560"
msgid "You should go to bed early."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10572"
msgid "Huh? But why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10584"
msgid ""
"You must be tired from work when you get home, right? You should hit the "
"sack early, or you'll end up more exhausted in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10596"
msgid "I suppose I should..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10608"
msgid ""
"I guess you're not really that interested in this conversation, Kiryu-san. "
"I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10632"
msgid "What's so fun about crosswords?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10644"
msgid ""
"The best thing about crossword puzzles is filling in the last clue! That "
"feeling of satisfaction is second to none."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10656"
msgid "I don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668"
msgid "All right, fine then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10680"
msgid "I'll just have to teach you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10692"
msgid ""
"I'm going to show you how much fun crossword puzzles can be! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10704"
msgid "Bring it on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10716"
msgid "Man... Guys sure do have it easy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10728"
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10740"
msgid "Well, for one, you don't have to take care of your skin like we do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10752"
msgid ""
"Between my age and my bodyboarding hobby, taking care of my skin has "
"started to become a real hassle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10764"
msgid ""
"I have to make sure I eat collagen-rich food, drink plenty of water, and "
"have enough vegetables, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10776"
msgid "Sounds rough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10788"
msgid "I use a lot of face cream, too, and that stuff isn't cheap..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10800"
msgid ""
"And Tuna's picky eating habits aren't making it easier on my wallet, "
"either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10812"
msgid "Sounds like a lot of effort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10824"
msgid ""
"That's right! That's why you guys should be a little more appreciative of "
"the effort us girls put into our appearances!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10836"
msgid "Will do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10848"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you're a little out of touch with these sorts of things, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10860"
msgid "I suppose you could say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10872"
msgid ""
"Hehe. ♪ You know, you looked really cute when you were thinking on that "
"just now, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10884"
msgid "Huh? What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10896"
msgid "I suppose guys don't have to do much, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10908"
msgid "Right!? Ugh. Sometimes I wish we had it as easy as you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10920"
msgid ""
"I wish you could understand the amount of work we put into our "
"appearance... and just who we're doing it for..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10932"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10944"
msgid "You don't have to do all that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10956"
msgid "What!? Of course I do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10968"
msgid "Why, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10980"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding me? I'd look like a wrinkled old lady if I didn't! All my "
"folds and blemishes would be on full display for all to see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10992"
msgid ""
"Although... if you said you'd still come to request me if I stopped doing "
"all that, I might give it a try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11004"
msgid "No, it's all right, you do what you have to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11016"
msgid "So recently, I've gotten into the habit of stretching before bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11028"
msgid "Now, I'm finding that I'm not tired in the mornings anymore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11040"
msgid "Wow, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11052"
msgid ""
"And it's not only that! It's helping with my dieting, too, and it makes me "
"feel so much more relaxed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11064"
msgid "Who knew stretching would be so good for me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11076"
msgid "Never would've guessed it myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11088"
msgid ""
"My body's gotten so much more flexible, too. I can even do the splits now! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11100"
msgid "You should give it a try, too, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11112"
msgid "Guess I'll give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11124"
msgid "Hehe! The best thing is, you don't need any special equipment!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11136"
msgid "That's true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11148"
msgid ""
"If you do the stretches wrong, though, you could end up injuring "
"yourself... be careful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11160"
msgid "Stretching is harder than it sounds..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11172"
msgid ""
"I could teach you how to stretch, then! It might be a little embarrassing, "
"but I'll push through... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11184"
msgid "Sounds great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11196"
msgid "I'll let you help me relax instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11208"
msgid "Umm... I was talking about stretching, not... that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11220"
msgid ""
"I don't need to stretch. I just need you by my side⑬that's enough to help "
"me relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11232"
msgid "I'm⑬ Sorry, are you trying to flirt with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11244"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11256"
msgid "I want to see you do the splits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11268"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11280"
msgid "...Is that a no?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11292"
msgid "Of course it's a no! I can't do the splits, not right here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11304"
msgid ""
"Why, if I did the splits right now, everyone in this club would get a good "
"look at my underwear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11316"
msgid "Right... Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11328"
msgid "Thank you for going along with my weird request, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11340"
msgid "I didn't think you'd really agree to pretend to be my boyfriend..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11352"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11364"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11376"
msgid "When are you meeting your father?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11388"
msgid "My dad hasn't called me yet, so I'm not sure when it'll happen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400"
msgid "All right, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11412"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11424"
msgid "I'm glad I get the chance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11436"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11448"
msgid "Oh, never mind! It's nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11460"
msgid "You sure you want me for the job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11472"
msgid "What are you saying!? Of course I want you for the job, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11484"
msgid "I think you'll be perfect for it, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11496"
msgid "Thank you so much for helping me. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11508"
msgid "...No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11520"
msgid "What should I say to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11532"
msgid "Don't worry, you won't have to say anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11544"
msgid "Let me do all the talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11556"
msgid "You sure that'll work out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11568"
msgid "Well, if it doesn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11580"
msgid ""
"...Then you can tell my dad that you love me. That should be enough to get "
"him off my case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11592"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11604"
msgid "I'm glad I get this chance, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11616"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11628"
msgid "Even if we're just pretending, I get a chance to be your boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11640"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11652"
msgid "I don't know what to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11664"
msgid "We don't have to pretend, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11676"
msgid "Oh! Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11688"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11700"
msgid "There must be something about you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11712"
msgid "Huh? Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11724"
msgid ""
"Well, whenever I'm with you, I feel like everything makes so much more "
"sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11736"
msgid "...How so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11748"
msgid ""
"When we first met, I wasn't sure what I was doing here in Okinawa, or why I "
"was feeling so conflicted..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11760"
msgid "I was so confused about myself, and my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11772"
msgid "But now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11784"
msgid ""
"It's been three years since I moved here, but only now do I finally "
"understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11796"
msgid "Understand what, now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11808"
msgid ""
"I... I ran away from a very fortunate, privileged life, one where my future "
"was guaranteed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11820"
msgid ""
"I never had to struggle with anything. All I had to do was be a good little "
"girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11832"
msgid "I've been completely spoiled my whole life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11856"
msgid "That's the reason I came to Okinawa, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11868"
msgid "I think I just wanted to start over from scratch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11880"
msgid "You do sound spoiled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11904"
msgid ""
"There are lots of people out there who don't have the luxury of living as "
"comfortably as you did. If they heard what you said just now, they'd be "
"dumbfounded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11916"
msgid "...You're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11928"
msgid "But... I think it's good you were able to realize that on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11940"
msgid "...Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11952"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11964"
msgid "Start over as many times as you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11976"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11988"
msgid ""
"No matter how many times you fail, you can always start over again. Just "
"keep moving forward. Find your own answers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12000"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12012"
msgid "Thank you so much... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12024"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12036"
msgid "I wish I could start over, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12048"
msgid "At least, the thought's crossed my mind more than once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12060"
msgid ""
"But no matter how careful you are about things, it's impossible to end up "
"with no regrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12072"
msgid ""
"There's nothing wrong with starting over from square one. Once you realize "
"that you might need to start over, then it's worth a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12084"
msgid "Thank you... <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12096"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12108"
msgid ""
"If I had known you in Tokyo, Kiryu-san... do you think I would have ever "
"come to Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12120"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12132"
msgid "Probably not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12144"
msgid "I guess you're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12156"
msgid ""
"I'm sure my life would have been very different had I known you when I "
"lived over there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12168"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12180"
msgid "Who knows, maybe we would've ended up living together out there, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12192"
msgid ""
"Oh, you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Are you being serious, or are you just "
"playing with my heart?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12204"
msgid "Heh... I'm serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12216"
msgid "Oh... I love you, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12228"
msgid "There's no way to know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12240"
msgid ""
"I guess so... Besides, we're only able to hang out like this because we met "
"here, in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12252"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12264"
msgid "I guess it was a silly thing to imagine in the first place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12276"
msgid ""
"Still... I'm really glad that I met you, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12288"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12300"
msgid "Bet we'd come here together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12312"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12324"
msgid "Let's see... We'd probably be drinking together somewhere right about now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12336"
msgid ""
