msgctxt "16872"
msgid ""
"I mean, you can see it in the rolling waves and the bright blue sky, and "
"the people who live here, too. They're so full of energy, you know? It's "
"that special Okinawan power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16884"
msgid "You've got a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16896"
msgid ""
"I've got to step up my game if I'm going to be as energetic as the natives! "
